{"v":3,"desc":"重回那令人著迷的恐怖世界──\n在《小小夢魘2》的懸疑冒險旅途中，您將化身為小男孩摩諾，身處在電波籠罩之下，因此變得扭曲的世界裡。\n\n摩諾將與穿著黃色雨衣的女孩──小六攜手合作，揭發訊號塔暗藏的祕密。\n然而這絕對不是一趟輕鬆的旅程：潛藏在這個世界中的未知威脅，正等著他們。\n\n準備好面對另一場兒時夢魘了嗎？","publisher":"BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Asia","release":"2026-06-04","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 7.1GB / Switch 7.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c71b8083ebdf8ddaec7f983f8020194625386d62d7d5032b5f2db0743b64494.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b6e41f1d0dbd99464a976d8856bbfc0b6032217a00cf065d639b398b54a924c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c03202ca2c0b5493026694a7d2122065a19f7e560e4cc5cf8911a14a5aac9f61.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b8bdfcd7dbb0af40c51c34cb5c835167960acec8639457efcebf30041f8c7de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/970618a95af552d97ad905ca72980ffc31350f083e9bb1518f8d6875966dc0a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7cf1940b4d3653a4168b5c1b847a2c46a456dedf895cc3076bdad5ee86db38be.jpg"],"titleId":"010097100edd6000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000071450","name":"小小夢魘2 喏姆的閣樓","img":"ad77b49b604c6faec31516be74be5d41a6b579d9133f893fdf1fd1efa72787a0","date":"2026-06-04","mem":false}]}